unsupported agents/polish.yaml#: a loop around one agent: MADL has no connection from an agent to itself, so the repeats are not drawn
approximated agents/search.yaml#: ADK waits for every branch before going on; in MADL the next agent receives each branch's handoff as it comes
approximated root_agent.yaml#/sub_agents: ADK hands the whole conversation back when a sub-agent transfers to its parent; drawn as `report`
